---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base
	title="Media and speaking"
	description="Press information for Steven Yule of OkArthur. Standard biography, photo, and topics for comment on digital, data and AI in infrastructure."
>
	<div class="page-head">
		<h1 class="page-title">Media and speaking</h1>
		<p class="lede">For journalists, producers and event organisers.</p>
	</div>

	<div class="prose reveal">
		<h2>Standard biography</h2>
		<p>
			Use this text verbatim. If space is short, cut from the end, not the
			middle.
		</p>
		<blockquote>
			Steven Yule is a chartered civil engineer who leads digital, data and AI
			work for infrastructure. Based in Dubai, he has spent 16 years across the
			Gulf and the UK making technology useful once it meets a live capital
			programme, including as project director of the first integrated
			infrastructure plan for the Riyadh region. Through OkArthur he reviews
			decisions for owners delivering more than one development at once, and
			advises boards. He is
			a Fellow of the Institution of Civil Engineers, an ICE Policy Fellow, the
			ICE UAE Country Representative and a non-executive director of Thomas
			Telford Ltd.
		</blockquote>

		<h2>Photo</h2>
		<img
			class="press-photo"
			src="/steven-yule.jpg"
			alt="Steven Yule, chartered civil engineer"
			width="1600"
			height="2463"
			loading="lazy"
		/>
		<p>
			This photo may be used for editorial coverage of Steven Yule or
			OkArthur. Credit is not required.
		</p>

		<h2>Topics</h2>
		<p>
			Comment, interviews and keynotes on digital, data and AI in
			infrastructure. How a change of plan at the top of a large owner travels
			through its developments. What an approved business case rests on, and
			who checks it afterwards. AI investment decisions and the evidence behind
			them. What owners should test before a digital or AI procurement goes to
			market. Data in capital programme delivery and handover. Whole-life asset
			decisions. What makes a model of an asset worth relying on.
		</p>

		<h2>Speaking</h2>
		<p>
			Recent talks, podcast appearances and published work are listed under <a
				href="/notes/">Notes</a
			>.
		</p>

		<h2>Enquiries</h2>
		<p>
			Email <a href="mailto:steven@okarthur.com">steven@okarthur.com</a> and
			mark it a press enquiry. Media requests get a same-day answer on
			availability.
		</p>
	</div>
</Base>
